flowchart TD
  A[Prime Verifiers v1 Taskset: support-preflight] --> B[Support agent: cheap model]
  B --> C[MCP tool calls]
  C --> D[Deterministic synthetic state transition]
  D --> E[Reward + independent business verifier]
  E --> B
  E --> F[Typed rollout state and trajectory collector]
  F --> G[Versioned JSONL: actions, states, reward, provenance]
  P[Labelled scripted adversarial probes] --> G
  G --> H[RL Environment X-Ray]
  H --> I[NetworkX directed multigraph]
  I --> J[SCC + witnessed cycles + consistency + scoped reachability]
  I -. experimental, not a gate .-> K[Incidence gradient / residual]
  J --> L[Standalone JSON / HTML report]
  K --> L
  L --> M{Preflight gate}
  M -->|FAIL| N[Fix rewards / verifier / observation]
  N --> A
  M -->|REVIEW| O[Add controls and inspect warnings]
  O --> G
  M -->|Scoped PASS| Q[Eligible for a small RL experiment]
  Q -. not executed in this demo .-> R[RL training]
